### Requests for the IntelliJ HTTP client. Run them top to bottom.
### Prerequisite: `docker compose up -d` and the app running on :8080.

@api = http://localhost:8080
@kc = http://localhost:8180/realms/auction/protocol/openid-connect/token

### 1. Token for alice (seller)
POST {{kc}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=auction-web&username=alice&password=alice

> {% client.global.set("alice", response.body.access_token); %}

### 2. Token for bob (bidder)
POST {{kc}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=auction-web&username=bob&password=bob

> {% client.global.set("bob", response.body.access_token); %}

### 3. Who am I?
GET {{api}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}

### 4. Alice lists an item
POST {{api}}/api/listings
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "PlayStation 5 - Disc Edition",
  "description": "Barely used, two controllers",
  "category": "GAMING",
  "condition": "LIKE_NEW"
}

> {% client.global.set("listingId", response.body.id); %}

### 5. Alice auctions it for 3 minutes (reserve 120)
< {% request.variables.set("endTime", new Date(Date.now() + 3 * 60 * 1000).toISOString()); %}
POST {{api}}/api/auctions
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "listingId": "{{listingId}}",
  "startingPrice": 100.00,
  "reservePrice": 120.00,
  "minIncrement": 5.00,
  "endTime": "{{endTime}}"
}

> {% client.global.set("auctionId", response.body.id); %}

### 6. Bob bids (re-run this request unchanged to see the idempotent replay)
POST {{api}}/api/auctions/{{auctionId}}/bids
Authorization: Bearer {{bob}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: bob-bid-1

{ "amount": 100.00 }

### 7. Live auctions (public, no token)
GET {{api}}/api/auctions/active

### 8. Auction state (public)
GET {{api}}/api/auctions/{{auctionId}}

### 9. Bid history (public)
GET {{api}}/api/auctions/{{auctionId}}/bids
